  m_Name: KartKupGame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MinigameDefinition
  <Id>k__BackingField: kart_kup
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 24
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 2
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: 120
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 1
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 3
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: Kart Kup
  <Description>k__BackingField: Three laps in karts round a race circuit. Grab item
    boxes for bananas, boosts and shocks!
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0749c200183a0db4f957ea96de655658, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Drive through item boxes, then press E to use the item
  - BANANA spins out whoever hits it, BOOST is a burst of speed, SHOCK shoves nearby karts away
  - Barriers bounce you back - brake before tight bends
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Finish three laps first.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Drive off the track and you're put back - but you lose time.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Finish order wins; the rest by laps and distance.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - W / S|Throttle / brake
  - A / D|Steer
  - SPACE|Hop
